BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[LA] Volunteer Outdoors at Redwood Grove in Los Altos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T120000
DTSTAMP:20260923T174415Z
UID:grassrootsecology-volunteer-outdoors-redwood-grove@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer your time to help increase biodiversity in Los Altos
  at Redwood Grove Nature Preserve!\n\nGrassroots Ecology has no minimum ag
 e\; children under 13 must be accompanied by an adult and a minor waiver i
 s required. Tools and gloves provided.\n\nAges: All ages (under-13 with ad
 ult\, minor waiver required)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://www.
 grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/03/volunteer-outdoors-redwood
 -grove\nLast synced: 2026-09-23 10:44 PDT
LOCATION:Redwood Grove Nature Preserve (map)
URL:https://www.grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/03/volunteer-
 outdoors-redwood-grove
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[PA] Compassion Week: Volunteer Outdoors at Foothills Nature Prese
 rve
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T120000
DTSTAMP:20260923T174415Z
UID:grassrootsecology-volunteer-outdoors-foothills-nature-preserve-compass
 ion-week@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer your time to prepare a planting area to increase bio
 diversity at Foothills Nature Preserve!\n\nGrassroots Ecology has no minim
 um age\; children under 13 must be accompanied by an adult and a minor wai
 ver is required. Tools and gloves provided.\n\nAges: All ages (under-13 wi
 th adult\, minor waiver required)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https:/
 /www.grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/07/volunteer-outdoors-fo
 othills-nature-preserve-compassion-week\nLast synced: 2026-09-23 10:44 PDT
LOCATION:Foothills Nature Preserve Interpretive Center (map)
URL:https://www.grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/07/volunteer-
