BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cantor Arts] Public Tour | A Closer Look
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T140000
DTSTAMP:20260923T174415Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53737430719656-53737430731955@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Discover new details\, perspectives\, and connections with Can
 tor’s “A Closer Look” tours. Led by a Stanford Student Guide or volu
 nteer Museum Engagement Guide\, each tour focuses on three to four artwork
 s organized around a theme\, providing participants with opportunities for
  contemplation and conversation.\n\nFirst come\, first served. Tours do no
 t require a reservation and are free of charge. The tour will last between
  45 minutes and an hour\, depending on the flow of conversation! Please ch
 eck in a\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://museum.stanford.edu/\nLast syn
 ced: 2026-09-23 10:44 PDT
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://museum.stanford.edu/
END:VEVENT
